@page "/blogpost/{BlogId:int}"

<div class="content">
    <div class="single-blog-post">
        <img class="single-blog-image" src="./Images/[@BlogId].jpg" alt="BlogPostImage" />
        <h2>@strBlogTitles[BlogId]</h2>
        <p>@strBlogContentOne[BlogId]</p>
        <p>@strBlogContentTwo[BlogId]</p>
    </div>
    <div class="author-details">
        <img class="author-profile" src="./Images/Author[@BlogId].jpg" alt="BloggerProfile" />
        <div>
            <h3>About Author</h3>
            <h4>@strAuthorName[BlogId]</h4>
            <p>@strAuthorDetails[BlogId]</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

@code {

    [Parameter]
    public int BlogId { get; set; }
    private string[] strBlogTitles = {
        "Blogger's Journey",
        "Art of Cooking",
        "Adventures of a Traveller",
        "Crochet Patterns",
        "Change your skin for the better",
        "Anxiety Relief for Pets"
    };
    private string[] strBlogContentOne = {
        "Blogs are a great way to share your thoughts and ideas with the world. Whether you're a seasoned writer or just starting out, there are plenty of platforms available to help you get your message out there.",
        "Cooking is an art that brings people together. Whether you're a novice in the kitchen or a seasoned chef, there's always something new to learn and explore.",
        "Traveling is one of the most enriching experiences one can have. It allows you to explore new cultures, meet new people, and create unforgettable memories.",
        "Learn how to crochet a flat circle following my step-by-step pattern. Flat circles are suitable for beginners and are quick and easy to make.",
        "Was it a new laundry detergent? Cutting out chocolate from your diet? Drinking more water? Wearing less makeup?",
        "Imagine this: you walk in the door, all set to play with your dog, but instead of a happy bark, you find them hiding or making sad sounds. It's tough for any dog owner to see."
    };

    private string[] strBlogContentTwo = {
        "From personal blogs to professional websites, the possibilities are endless. So why not start your own blog today? With a little creativity and dedication, you can create a space that reflects your unique voice and perspective. You can even earn money from blogging!!",
        "From trying out new recipes to experimenting with different ingredients, cooking can be a fun and rewarding experience. So why not get creative in the kitchen? With a little imagination and a willingness to try new things, you can whip up delicious meals that will impress your family and friends. Cooking is not just about feeding your body; it's about nourishing your soul. So put on your apron and get cooking!",
        "Whether you're backpacking through Europe or relaxing on a beach in the Caribbean, there's something magical about discovering new places. So why not pack your bags and hit the road? With a little planning and an open mind, you can embark on an adventure that will broaden your horizons and change your life. Traveling is not just about the destination; it's about the journey. So go out there and explore the world!",
        "They are also really versatile and can be used for many projects including: coasters, placemats the base of a nesting basket/storage pot and even reusable eco-friendly face scrubbies.",
        "Trimming your bangs? Going to bed earlier? Finding a new product? A procedure? A new dermatologist whose knowledge parted the clouds and let the sun shine through? There are a few things that really helped me, but one immediately springs to mind: Kate Somerville Anti-Bac Clearing Lotion, which I’ve been using and loving for years. Finding it straight-up drastically changed my skin for the better. Without it, I will break out, no question.",
        "Dogs can feel anxious, Many pet owners feel really sad when they see their pet feeling anxious or upset. From separation anxiety to noise phobias, our pets can experience a range of worries just like humans do.There are natural helpers for pets  CBD oil for pets. They're natural ways to make our pets feel better when they're feeling stressed."
    };
    private string[] strAuthorName = {
        "Alexa",
        "Siri",
        "Sam",
        "Bella",
        "Mia",
        "Lucas"
    };
    private string[] strAuthorDetails = {
        "Content Creator, Journalist, and Freelance Writer",
        "Cook, Entertainer, and Influencer",
        "Business Owner, Traveller, and Influencer",
        "Business Owner, Crocheter, and Blogger",
        "Content Creator, Influencer, and Blogger",
        "Pet Owner, Influencer, and Blogger"
    };
}
